  "_about": "Seed for src/lib/qloo/registry.ts. Built from the Entity Type Parameter Guide (2026-07-08), cross-checked against the Parameter Reference and the Insights API Deep Dive OpenAPI (both 2026-07-08). 'listed' = named for that type in the per-type guide. referenceOnly = documented elsewhere (Parameter Reference or Deep Dive) but NOT in the per-type guide: the client must refuse them until the spike marks them confirmed. Names only; no Qloo response data. Search and tag endpoint param lists come from the Search Entities (2026-07-20) and Search Tags (2026-07-08) OpenAPI pages; tag insights params come from the Taste Analysis page (2025-11-12).",
